*&
*&
*&---------------------------------------------------------------------*

REPORT  ZMAP_GLOBAL.

SELECTION-SCREEN BEGIN OF BLOCK PARAMETER WITH FRAME TITLE TEXT-001.
PARAMETER: RB_TYPE  RADIOBUTTON GROUP RB DEFAULT 'X'.
PARAMETER: RB_LABEL RADIOBUTTON GROUP RB.
PARAMETER: RB_PG    RADIOBUTTON GROUP RB.
PARAMETER: RB_COA   RADIOBUTTON GROUP RB.
SELECTION-SCREEN END OF BLOCK PARAMETER.

START-OF-SELECTION.
  IF RB_TYPE EQ 'X'.
    SUBMIT ZMAP_TYPE VIA SELECTION-SCREEN AND RETURN.
  ENDIF.

  IF RB_LABEL EQ 'X'.
    SUBMIT ZLABEL_MAP VIA SELECTION-SCREEN AND RETURN.
  ENDIF.

  IF RB_PG EQ 'X'.
    SUBMIT ZMM_MAP_MENU VIA SELECTION-SCREEN AND RETURN.
  ENDIF.

  IF RB_COA EQ 'X'.
    SUBMIT ZMAP_COA VIA SELECTION-SCREEN AND RETURN.
  ENDIF.
END-OF-SELECTION.